Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.11,1:37:48.00,SekkonSigns,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fad(100,250)\bord0\p1\c&H000000&}m 0 0 l 1920 0 1920 165 0 165 c
Dialogue: 1,1:35:26.20,1:35:30.90,Credits Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Those who fought gave their all gone with no trace
Dialogue: 1,1:35:30.90,1:35:35.60,Credits Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}In the night do they dream of peaceful days with loved ones?
Dialogue: 1,1:35:35.60,1:35:44.60,Credits Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Subete netsu wa kiesatta hito no mono mo hi no mono mo
Dialogue: 1,1:35:45.35,1:35:54.07,Credits Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Arehateta sono bohyou ni yose
Dialogue: 1,1:35:54.07,1:36:02.37,Credits Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Hana tamukeru tomo sae mou inai
Dialogue: 1,1:36:02.37,1:36:03.30,Credits Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Still with us
Dialogue: 1,1:36:03.30,1:36:05.70,Credits Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Feel the calling out to you
Dialogue: 1,1:36:05.70,1:36:12.70,Credits Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Itami nageki mo ima wa mou mu ni kisu
Dialogue: 1,1:36:12.70,1:36:15.10,Credits Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}It's a soundless calling out to you
Dialogue: 1,1:36:15.10,1:36:22.10,Credits Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Kasuka ka tadayou kanashimi no nokorika
Dialogue: 1,1:36:32.45,1:36:41.25,Credits Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Omoide no hi itamu koto sae mo
Dialogue: 1,1:36:41.25,1:36:49.30,Credits Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Naki hito-ra o iyashikireru mono ka
Dialogue: 1,1:36:49.30,1:36:50.40,Credits Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Still wandering
Dialogue: 1,1:36:50.40,1:36:52.65,Credits Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Chase the memory of you
Dialogue: 1,1:36:52.65,1:36:59.55,Credits Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Sono imi toe ba mujou ni ochiteku
Dialogue: 1,1:36:59.55,1:37:02.15,Credits Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}It's a touchless memory of you
Dialogue: 1,1:37:02.15,1:37:12.45,Credits Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Uchihishigarete shizuka ni wasurere ba ii
Dialogue: 1,1:37:28.00,1:37:31.55,Credits Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}You're feeling the calling out to you
Dialogue: 1,1:37:31.55,1:37:38.35,Credits Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Itami nageki mo ima wa mou mu ni kisu
Dialogue: 1,1:37:38.35,1:37:40.95,Credits Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}It's a soundless calling out to you
Dialogue: 1,1:37:40.95,1:37:48.00,Credits Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Kasuka ka tadayou kanashimi no nokorika
Dialogue: 1,1:35:26.20,1:35:30.90,Credits Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Aqueles que lutaram dando tudo de si sem deixar vestígios
Dialogue: 1,1:35:30.90,1:35:35.60,Credits Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Durante a noite eles sonham com os dias pacíficos e seus entes queridos?
Dialogue: 1,1:35:35.60,1:35:44.60,Credits Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Todo o calor se foi, de todos os seres humanos e de todas as chamas
Dialogue: 1,1:35:45.35,1:35:54.07,Credits Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Um túmulo em ruínas
Dialogue: 1,1:35:54.07,1:36:02.37,Credits Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Não há mais amigos para deixar algumas flores
Dialogue: 1,1:36:02.37,1:36:03.30,Credits Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Ainda conosco
Dialogue: 1,1:36:03.30,1:36:05.70,Credits Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Sinto algo chamando por você
Dialogue: 1,1:36:05.70,1:36:12.70,Credits Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Dor e agonia se transformam em nada
Dialogue: 1,1:36:12.70,1:36:15.10,Credits Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}É um chamado silencioso por você
Dialogue: 1,1:36:15.10,1:36:22.10,Credits Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Uma leve fragrância de tristeza é deixada para trás
Dialogue: 1,1:36:32.45,1:36:41.25,Credits Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Luto e lembranças das memórias
Dialogue: 1,1:36:41.25,1:36:49.30,Credits Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Curará os mortos?
Dialogue: 1,1:36:49.30,1:36:50.40,Credits Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Ainda vagando
Dialogue: 1,1:36:50.40,1:36:52.65,Credits Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Perseguindo as memórias até você
Dialogue: 1,1:36:52.65,1:36:59.55,Credits Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Se eu questionar o significado, cairei em profunda crueldade
Dialogue: 1,1:36:59.55,1:37:02.15,Credits Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}É uma memória sem o seu toque
Dialogue: 1,1:37:02.15,1:37:12.45,Credits Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Me fere brutalmente e me faz esquecê-lo silenciosamente
Dialogue: 1,1:37:28.00,1:37:31.55,Credits Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Você está sentindo algo chamando por você
Dialogue: 1,1:37:31.55,1:37:38.35,Credits Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Dor e agonia se transformam em nada
Dialogue: 1,1:37:38.35,1:37:40.95,Credits Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}É um chamado silencioso por você
Dialogue: 1,1:37:40.95,1:37:48.00,Credits Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Uma leve fragrância de tristeza é deixada para trás
